```

Use a driver web app for:

- live route map;
- multi-stop sequence;
- order details;
- proof of delivery;
- cash balance;
- incident reporting;
- shift history;
- earnings.

WhatsApp alone is not sufficient for safe multi-stop routing and live operational visibility.

## 5.2 Driver task card

```text
📦 New delivery task

Pickup: [Restaurant]
Area: [Village]
Ready: [Time]
Drop-off: [Village + landmark]
Route: [actual road time]
Orders: [1 or 2]
Cash to collect: [$ / LBP]
