[Accept] [Decline] [Navigate]
```

For a batch, show each order separately and clearly label the sequence.

## 5.3 Customer tracking

The customer tracking page should show:

- order status;
- driver first name only;
- vehicle type or neutral delivery icon;
- approximate ETA;
- last known location;
- weak-signal message when GPS is stale;
- support button.

Do not expose a driver’s personal phone number by default.

