# 7. Cash and payment operations

## 7.1 Cash-on-delivery controls

For each active driver store:

```text
cash_usd_expected
cash_lbp_expected
cash_collected_usd
cash_collected_lbp
cash_limit
last_reconciled_at
```

Rules:

- show the exact expected collection amount;
- support USD and LBP separately;
- store the exchange rate used for the order;
- calculate change requirements before dispatch;
- stop assigning new COD orders when the driver reaches the cash limit;
- require reconciliation at shift end.

## 7.2 Customer cannot pay

Do not let the driver improvise a policy.

Options:

```text
Customer pays exact amount
Customer pays approved alternative currency
Customer contacts support
Order returns/exception process
```

Record the reason and who bears the loss according to the approved policy.

## 7.3 Online payments

The driver should never see sensitive card information.

The order is dispatchable only when the payment backend provides a verified success event. A screenshot or customer claim is not payment confirmation.

